    {
      "text": "%md\n## Description\nthis function provide user to run notebook parallel in same note and also provide user to set parameter to notebook.\n\n## Parameters\n- **concurrentParallel:** The number of parallel Notebook to run in the same time.(can be set to be less than the number of total parallel notebook.)\n- **language:** The code language that user can choose only \"python\" or \"scala\".\n- **timeSleep:** The delay time that is setup to start this Notebook Run parallel service. The best practice should be 10 second. (Unit is second.)\n- **timeout:** Fill in the specific time for timeout. (Unit is second.)\n- **notebookAddParameterRequest:** To setup the parameter under the parallel Notebook.\n    - **notebookId:** The Notebook ID.\n    - **titleName:** Fill in a title name of the selected Notebook. If the user needs to replace the parameter of all titles under this Notebook,\n        users can use \"all\" instead of titleName parameter.\n    - **parameter:** Name of parameter.\n    - **value:** Value of parameter.\n- **description** For enable function to return all result of all paragraph\n\n## Result\nUrl of **public** notebook that save all the result in the parallel job and the status of notebook. if success all the paragraph will return success otherwise will return fail.\n\n**#Note: Url of **public** notebook will expire in 30 days**\n",
      "user": "anonymous",
      "dateUpdated": "2024-10-01 12:41:17.142",
      "progress": 0,
      "config": {
        "tableHide": false,
        "editorSetting": {
          "language": "markdown",
          "editOnDblClick": true,
          "completionKey": "TAB",
          "completionSupport": false
        },
        "colWidth": 12.0,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "fontSize": 9.0,
        "editorHide": true,
