        "enabled": true
      },
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      },
      "results": {
        "code": "SUCCESS",
        "msg": [
          {
            "type": "HTML",
            "data": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"markdown-body\"\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eDescription\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ethis function provide user to run notebook parallel in same note and also provide user to set parameter to notebook.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eParameters\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003econcurrentParallel:\u003c/strong\u003e The number of parallel Notebook to run in the same time.(can be set to be less than the number of total parallel notebook.)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003elanguage:\u003c/strong\u003e The code language that user can choose only \u0026ldquo;python\u0026rdquo; or \u0026ldquo;scala\u0026rdquo;.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003etimeSleep:\u003c/strong\u003e The delay time that is setup to start this Notebook Run parallel service. The best practice should be 10 second. (Unit is second.)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003etimeout:\u003c/strong\u003e Fill in the specific time for timeout. (Unit is second.)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003enotebookAddParameterRequest:\u003c/strong\u003e To setup the parameter under the parallel Notebook.\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003enotebookId:\u003c/strong\u003e The Notebook ID.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003etitleName:\u003c/strong\u003e Fill in a title name of the selected Notebook. If the user needs to replace the parameter of all titles under this Notebook,\u003cbr /\u003e\nusers can use \u0026ldquo;all\u0026rdquo; instead of titleName parameter.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eparameter:\u003c/strong\u003e Name of parameter.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003evalue:\u003c/strong\u003e Value of parameter.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003edescription\u003c/strong\u003e For enable function to return all result of all paragraph\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eResult\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUrl of \u003cstrong\u003epublic\u003c/strong\u003e notebook that save all the result in the parallel job and the status of notebook. if success all the paragraph will return success otherwise will return fail.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e#Note: Url of \u003cstrong\u003epublic\u003c/strong\u003e notebook will expire in 30 days\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e"
          }
        ]
      },
