      "text": "%python\nimport blendata_util_py\n\n#Example3 run parallel with differant notebook id\ntimeSleep \u003d 10\ntimeout \u003d 300\nconcurrentParallel \u003d 2\nlanguage \u003d \"python\"\nnotebookAddParameterRequest \u003d [\n    {\n        \"notebookId\": \"2K4G26M8B\",\n        \"addParameterMapFromTitle\": {\n            \"Title1\": {\n                \"a\" : \"round2 work\"\n            },\n            \"Title2\": {\n                \"b\": 20\n            },\n            \"Title3\": {\n                \"c\": [10,12,14,15]\n            },\n            \"all\": {\n                \"b\": 5.1,\n                \"d\": 4.9\n            }\n        }\n    },\n    {\n     \"notebookId\" : \"2K63AR51P\",\n     \"addParameterMapFromTitle\": {}\n    }\n]\ndescription \u003d True\n\nresult  \u003d blendata_util_py.hera_api_runParallelLog(timeSleep,timeout,concurrentParallel,language,notebookAddParameterRequest, description)\nprint(result)",
